---
name: control-in-app-browser
description: "Control the in-app Browser. Use to open, navigate, inspect, test, click, type, screenshot, or verify local targets such as localhost, 127.0.0.1, ::1, file://, the current in-app browser tab, and websites shown side by side inside ChatGPT."
